            <p>Renim AI is built from the ground up as a unified daily command center. Instead of having your meeting transcripts in one app, your tasks in another, your calendar in a third, and your thoughts in a fourth, Renim AI synchronizes them all together with an AI Copilot that has full context of your entire workday.</p>
